---
import { ACCESS_URL } from "../lib/site";
---
<section class="m-section" id="publishing" aria-labelledby="publishing-title"><div class="m-split">
 <div class="m-shell"><div class="m-panel editor-demo" aria-label="Example publishing workspace"><div class="editor-bar"><span>fieldnotes / articles</span><span class="draft-label">Draft saved</span></div><div class="editor-document"><div class="article-category">Engineering</div><h3>Good ideas deserve<br/>a place to live.</h3><p>Notes from building, learning and putting something useful into the world.</p><div class="editor-line"></div><div class="editor-line shorter"></div><div class="editor-image"><span>Room for the whole story.</span></div><div class="editor-line"></div><div class="editor-line shorter"></div></div><div class="editor-footer"><span>Private until you publish</span><span class="publish-example">Publish</span></div></div></div>
 <div><div class="m-eyebrow">The writing experience</div><h2 class="m-title" id="publishing-title">From a rough idea<br/>to <em>worth reading.</em></h2><p class="m-copy">An editor for the work of writing. Add images, code, quotes and headings. Keep changes in private drafts, preview the result, and publish when the story is ready.</p><div class="publishing-points"><p><strong>Your live article stays live.</strong><br/><span>Make a new revision without exposing unfinished edits.</span></p><p><strong>Bring your people.</strong><br/><span>Write alone, add your team, or invite an editor to one blog.</span></p><p><strong>Your work belongs to you.</strong><br/><span>Export your posts, drafts, tags and media whenever you need them.</span></p></div><div class="m-actions"><a class="m-button" href={ACCESS_URL}>Start writing</a></div></div>
</div></section>
<style>.editor-bar,.editor-footer{padding:17px 22px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font:400 .73rem var(--mono);color:var(--text-muted)}.editor-bar{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}.draft-label{color:#c2d19f}.editor-document{padding:38px 34px 30px}.article-category{font:400 .7rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase}.editor-document h3{font:400 clamp(2rem,3vw,2.9rem)/1.08 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:18px 0}.editor-document p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:26px}.editor-line{height:7px;border-radius:8px;background:#252528;margin:11px 0;width:94%}.editor-line.shorter{width:72%}.editor-image{height:130px;border-radius:7px;margin:25px 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 120%,#708344 0%,#353c27 30%,#1a1d15 67%);display:flex;align-items:end;padding:18px}.editor-image span{font:400 1.35rem var(--serif);color:#dfe5ce}.editor-footer{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}.publish-example{padding:6px 15px;background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);border-radius:5px;font:500 .75rem var(--sans)}.publishing-points{margin-top:28px;display:grid;gap:18px}.publishing-points strong{font-weight:500}.publishing-points span{color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.92rem}@media(max-width:480px){.editor-document{padding:28px 22px}.editor-bar,.editor-footer{font-size:.65rem;padding:15px}.editor-image{height:110px}}</style>
